  "description": "Smart specification for the city, but with true off-road ability. Our SUV-style e-bike uses a powerful Bosch drive system to help support your riding, while the full suspension frame and full-equipped setup keep you safe and comfortable on streets or trails.\n\nThe ETMO 500 EQ uses our off-road ready frame and some urban-friendly kit to create the perfect rugged SUV e-bike for town, city or country. With a powerful Bosch PX drive system with 90 Nm of torque to make light work of hills and a 600 Wh battery to do that all day long, it's safe and comfortable on city streets or countryside trails. Fast-rolling Maxxis tyres work with the 140 mm of full suspension to deliver a smooth and safe ride, no matter how rough the roads get, while predictable shifting from Shimano and powerful SRAM brakes will deliver no-fuss performance every ride.\n\nA quality e-MTB means more runs, more fun and more time just getting out there. This is why we’ve created the MERIDA ETMO, our most price-focussed Bosch-powered e-MTB ever. We’ve used all our aluminium frame design and manufacturing know-how to create a durable frame that takes inspiration from the award-winning long-travel eONE-EIGHTY, but in an extra versatile and affordable package. The ETMO uses 160 mm of travel* at either end and mixed wheel sizes, so it’s fun and fast on any terrain, with handling that’ll bring a smile to the face of experienced riders and fresh faces alike. We've backed this up with our lifetime frame warranty too.\n\nWith the proven and trusted power of Bosch pedal assistance, the ETMO offers battery and drive unit options for every need and wallet, with 540, 600 or 800 Wh internal batteries and the choice of powerful CX or high-value PX drive units depending on the model. We also have EQ models that come fully equipped with fenders, lights, kickstand and rear rack for urban SUV use, plus PRO models that have upgraded drive unit and battery specs.\n\n*Some models come with 140 mm fork and and 143 mm rear travel.",
